  <annotation>
    <documentation>
			2011-03-06, Nisch, Made NatureOfPerson,SellingPriceAmt and Conveyancer Name and Firm mandatory
			Changed VatRateInd from indicator to enumeration with values "Z" and "S"		
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2011-11-28, Nisch, changed YesNoBlankIndType to locally defined YesNoIndType
			Changed Wizard Information structure and TransferDuty element to be mandatory and to remove the NoOfPropertyDetails element
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2011-11-24, Edwin, referenced version 54.2 of basetypes
			and 54.2 of enterprise
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2011-11-01, Nisch, Changed restriction on ExemptType to
			35 characters, TransactionType to be 100 characters and
			NatureOfPerson to use the EntityType from the basetypes
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2011-09-26, Nisch, Split up elements for sellers/buyers
			from shareholders in wizard. Extended length of property description.
			Reduced length of exemption type. Added residential property company.
			Changed order of Dominium and Fideicommissum fields in wizard
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2011-09-20, Nisch
			Referenced version 54.1 of basetypes
			and enterprise
			Added Firm to ConveyancerDetails
			Replaced Seller and
			Conveyancer valuations with LocalValuationAmt, BondAmt,
			PropertyValueAmt, MonthlyRentalAmt, LandValueAmt,
			OccupationalRentAmt,ImprovementValueAmt, SellingPriceAmt,
			TotalFairAmt, OtherConsiderationAmt, TotalConsiderationAmt
			Corrected
			spelling of EXEMPTION_CERTIFICATE enumeration in AssessmentType

		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2018-03-14 Matimu Rikhotso
			DeedsNo set to maximum of 30 and Mandatory
			In the Wizard TransferDutyType changed to optional
			
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2018-04-09 Matimu Rikhotso, Dirk Grobler.
			DeedsNo set to minimum length of 0 and made optional.
			Referenced SARSGMD_BaseTypesV54.2.1.xsd.
			Referenced SARSGMD_EnterpriseV54.2.1.xsd.
			
		</documentation>
    <documentation>
			2025-09-02 Commet Madupela, Added new fields on PropertyRepresentativeStructure
			Removed New Shareholders and existing Shareholders structures
		</documentation>
